<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

	<!-- Misc -->
	
	<!-- EN: Body clock -->
  <NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock>生物鐘</NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock>
	<!-- EN: Determines when the animal sleeps and when it is awake.\n\nDiurnal animals sleep during the night and are awake during the day, while nocturnal animals sleep during the day and are awake during the night. Crepuscular animals are mainly active during dusk. -->
  <NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Description>決定動物什麼時候睡覺，什麼時候醒著。白天活動的動物在晚上睡覺，白天醒著；夜間活動的動物在白天睡覺，晚上醒著。</NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Description>

	<!-- EN: Diurnal -->
  <NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Diurnal>白晝</NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Diurnal>
	<!-- EN: Nocturnal -->
  <NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Nocturnal>午夜</NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Nocturnal>
	<!-- EN: Crepuscular -->
  <NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Crepuscular>黃昏</NocturnalAnimals.BodyClock_Crepuscular>

	<!-- EN: Release to the wild -->
  <VAEE.ReleaseIntoWild>放歸自然</VAEE.ReleaseIntoWild>
	<!-- EN: Release this animal to the wild and increase relations with tribal and outlander factions. -->
  <VAEE.ReleaseIntoWildDesc>將這隻動物放歸自然，並改善與部落和外來者派系的關係。</VAEE.ReleaseIntoWildDesc>
	<!-- EN: Release to repopulate -->
  <VAEE.ReleaseToRepopulate>放歸重新繁殖</VAEE.ReleaseToRepopulate>
	<!-- EN: Release this animal to the wild to repupulate and increase relations with tribal and outlander factions. -->
  <VAEE.ReleaseToRepopulateDesc>將這種動物放歸自然重新繁殖以擴大種群數量，可改善與部落和外來者派系的關係。</VAEE.ReleaseToRepopulateDesc>
	<!-- EN: Endangered Animals. -->
  <VAEE.LetterLabelExtintAnimalsPasses>瀕危動物。</VAEE.LetterLabelExtintAnimalsPasses>
	<!-- EN: A pair of {0}, critically endangered, have wandered into the area.\n\nThey can easily fall prey to larger predators and poachers, but you can tame them and bring them to safety. \n\nReleasing endangered animals into the wild will boost relations with tribal and outlander factions. -->
  <VAEE.LetterExtintAnimalsPasses>一對瀕臨滅絕的{0}已經遊蕩到本地區。\n\n它們很容易成為大型捕食者和偷獵者的獵物，但你可以馴服它們並把它們帶到安全的地方。\n\n將瀕危動物放歸自然可改善與部落和外來者派系的關係。</VAEE.LetterExtintAnimalsPasses>
	<!-- EN: A pair of {0}, critically endangered, have wandered into the area.\n\nThey can easily fall prey to larger predators and poachers, but you can tame them and bring them to safety. \n\nReleasing endangered animals into the wild to repopulate the species will boost relations with tribal and outlander factions. -->
  <VAEE.LetterExtintAnimalsPassesRepopulate>一對瀕臨滅絕的{0}已經遊蕩到本地區。\n\n它們很容易成為大型捕食者和偷獵者的獵物，但你可以馴服它們並把它們帶到安全的地方。\n\n將瀕危動物放歸自然重新繁殖以擴大種群數量，可改善與部落和外來者派系的關係。</VAEE.LetterExtintAnimalsPassesRepopulate>
	<!-- EN: Releasing an endangered animal into the wild improved relations with tribal and outlander factions by +2. -->
  <VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildMessage>因將瀕危動物放歸自然，你與部落和外來者派系的關係提高了2。</VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildMessage>
	<!-- EN: Releasing an endangered animal into the wild to repopulate the species improved relations with tribal and outlander factions by +2. -->
  <VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildMessageRepopulate>因將瀕危動物放歸自然重新繁殖以擴大種群數量，你與部落和外來者派系的關係提高了2。</VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildMessageRepopulate>
	<!-- EN: Releasing to the wild\n\nReleasing an animal to the wild means you will never see it again, as the animal will walk off the map. -->
  <VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildConfirmation>放歸自然\n\n將動物放歸自然意味著你再也見不到它了，因為動物會離開地圖。</VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildConfirmation>
	<!-- EN: Releasing to repopulate\n\nReleasing an animal to the wild to repopulate the species means you will never see it again, as the animal will walk off the map. -->
  <VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildConfirmationRepopulate>放歸重新繁殖\n\n將動物放歸自然重新繁殖以擴大種群數量意味著你再也見不到它了，因為動物會離開地圖。</VAEE.ReleasingToTheWildConfirmationRepopulate>
	<!-- EN: Cancel -->
  <VAEE.Cancel>取消</VAEE.Cancel>
	<!-- EN: Add release into wild button to all animals -->
  <VAEE.AddBanishGizmoToAllAnimals>將所有動物標記為放歸自然</VAEE.AddBanishGizmoToAllAnimals>
	<!-- EN: Add release to repopulate button to all animals -->
  <VAEE.AddBanishGizmoToAllAnimalsRepopulate>將所有動物標記為放歸重新繁殖</VAEE.AddBanishGizmoToAllAnimalsRepopulate>
